			<Property name="Id" value="OPTION_HUD_MINIMAL_D" />
			<Property name="English" value="Determines the visibility of Heads-Up Display (HUD) elements, such as the reticle, compass, and Hazard Protection and Life Support bars.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STELLAR&gt;Full&lt;&gt; - The reticle and compass are always displayed, and other elements appear when appropriate for the context (for example, Hazard Protection information when in a hazardous environment).&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STELLAR&gt;Minimal&lt;&gt; - Hides most HUD elements, and minimises mission notifications. HUD elements can be still displayed for a brief period with &lt;IMG&gt;SHOWHUD&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STELLAR&gt;Hidden&lt;&gt; - Hides all HUD elements. Provides a more immersive experience, especially for taking screenshots, but reduces access to important gameplay information.&#xA;&#xA;Default value is: &lt;CATALYST&gt;%DEFAULTVALUE%&lt;&gt;" />
