		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_WAKE_TITAN_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_WAKE_TITAN_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="By 2017 we knew there was a core community of players who loved the game, and they were the people we deeply cared about. We desperately wanted to find a way to communicate with them and let them know we were listening, whilst we focused on the game.&#xA;&#xA;Then the thought came: we've always loved ARGs! What about an Augmented Reality Game? This became &lt;STELLAR&gt;Waking Titan&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;We posted physical cassette tapes to 16 prominent members of the NMS community, and invited players to explore a website filled with cyphers and mysterious documents. Players travelled to real world live drop locations, and met with agents from the mysterious &quot;Atlas Foundation&quot;. There was a live stream of a hamster. We loved it!&#xA;&#xA;Together with the ARG puppet masters, it felt like we were enjoying a game with friends in the community. Some of our ideas went a bit too far. We were advised that our insurance didn't cover inviting players into the studio and arming them with blowtorches to extract a key from an ice sculpture. We still think that would have been fine." />
