			<Property name="English" value="After NEXT, we wanted to try a more regular rhythm of smaller releases before the next huge named update.&#xA;&#xA;We surveyed the community to get a sense of what players wanted most, and planned out an &quot;underwater update&quot;, which became The Abyss, a &quot;biomes update&quot;, which became Visions, and an &quot;exocraft update&quot;...&#xA;&#xA;...which introduced the Pilgrim exocraft, exocraft customisation, techs, and other improvements... and which we quietly blogged about under the unassuming title &lt;STELLAR&gt;Development Update 5&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;At this point we were still trying to figure out whether to do yearly huge updates or more regular, smaller ones." />
