		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_GOT_PETS_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_GOT_PETS_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="The procedurally-generated creatures in No Man's Sky are an ongoing source of joy. They still make us laugh. The team still sends screenshots and videos around when we find a particularly beautiful, surprising or funny animal. We wanted to add more ways for players to interact with them, to make them feel more connected and alive.&#xA;&#xA;The design for &lt;STELLAR&gt;Companions&lt;&gt; went through several iterations. At one point, the concept revolved around collecting DNA samples from wild creatures to grow new life in a laboratory setting. But in playtesting we found it was more satisfying to hunt down and adopt a pet, similar to hunting down the perfect ship. We love seeing players sharing images of their weird and wonderful pets." />
