		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_PRISMS_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_PRISMS_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="The backbone of No Man's Sky is our custom engine, which we continue to expand and improve with every update.&#xA;&#xA;As well as handling the memory and performance challenges that come with an infinite, procedurally-generated universe running on two generations of consoles, our engine team are constantly pushing graphical limits to make that universe just a little more beautiful. &#xA;&#xA;Some of our rendering improvements come from art team requests, and others are driven from within the engine team itself. In &lt;STELLAR&gt;Prisms&lt;&gt;, we tried to gather and showcase a bunch of graphical improvements all at once: adding things like volumetric lighting, screen-space reflections, and furry creatures. We work on No Man's Sky every day motivated by the technical endeavour as much as that sci-fi fantasy." />
			<Property name="French" value="" />
			<Property name="Italian" value="" />
			<Property name="German" value="" />
