			<Property name="English" value="No Man's Sky is a game about exploration and combat may not be the main focus, but Sentinels patrol almost every planet. We wanted to make fighting them feel more tactical and interesting.&#xA;&#xA;The &lt;STELLAR&gt;Sentinel&lt;&gt; update added different varieties of Sentinel drones - repair drones, heavies, and summoners. We improved the feel of ground combat across the board with lots of new abilities and tech. We even created a new story-based mission for players to construct their own drone companion, and upgrade their Exo-Mech! This was supposed to be a smaller update but in the end the patch notes amounted to more than 250 items!" />
