		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_ENDURANCE_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_ENDURANCE_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STELLAR&gt;Endurance&lt;&gt; hugely changed the scope of building a base on your freighter, a feature which had been largely untouched since introduced in Foundation. It was especially exciting to be able to build exterior catwalks and observation decks - something not possible before... &#xA;&#xA;Rendering windows and exterior walkways in space is a particularly hard technical problem. The moment we first saw the view from the deck, we just knew we had to support it.&#xA;&#xA;In fact the way we built freighters initially used a lot of smoke and mirrors and this made it particularly hard to support most of these new features. For instance, newer players might not remember a time before you could teleport from the freighter hangar to the bridge... such a great quality of life improvement! Even just that simple feature required some real technical wizardry going on behind the scenes to make that work." />
