		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_FRACTAL_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_FRACTAL_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STELLAR&gt;Fractal&lt;&gt; was an opportunity for the team to give No Man's Sky another scrub and coat of polish. We improved graphics, increased accessibility, and launched the Utopia expedition. We also added &quot;Wonders&quot; to showcase the most remarkable discoveries among the thousands players would amass on their journeys. This was something we'd wanted for a long time." />
