		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_S23_CATCH_RARE_FISH_LOG">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_CATCH_RARE_FISH_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="We work very quickly at Hello, with more of a game jam kind of vibe. New team members who join us from other studios often comment how fast new features come together. Fishing was one of those features! We saw a fan posting about how cool fishing would be, and just weeks later our fishing update was releasing! We designed the &lt;STELLAR&gt;Aquarius&lt;&gt; expedition around it and we love that it's a very chill way for people to spend time together on a planet. Seeing screenshots of lots of players fishing side-by-side makes us so happy.&#xA;&#xA;For Halloween, we put together a spooky expedition called The Cursed, which started with the idea of limiting interstellar travel to the portal network, and grew to introduce elements like spectral squids and a sped-up day/night cycle.&#xA;&#xA;In November 2024, our global user rating progressed from &quot;Mostly Positive&quot; to &quot;Very Positive&quot;. We got some &quot;Very Positive&quot; socks made for the team, which you only wear when you are really feeling it. " />
