			<Property name="Id" value="UI_S23_GOT_FOSSILS_LOG" />
			<Property name="English" value="The idea for &lt;STELLAR&gt;Relics&lt;&gt; came from one of our team playing Animal Crossing with their daughter. The idea of collecting fossils for a bone museum fit perfectly with several elements of No Man's Sky: exploration, collecting, procedurally generated creatures, and the modular customisation system we'd established back in Echoes.&#xA;&#xA;Video game publications cover No Man's Sky pretty regularly, but this update earnt us a tongue-in-cheek article in a museum industry magazine. The author noted that &quot;While Relics is certainly fun, as a museum professional there is a lot that I found concerning.&quot; &quot;I'm [...] troubled that said relics are then promptly shipped off to your home planet to be displayed in your own private (unaccredited) museum.&quot;" />
