			<Property name="English" value="Our most recent update is &lt;STELLAR&gt;Cosmos&lt;&gt;, bringing together a number of highly-requested features, and some we dreamt up internally: space station ownership, shipbreaking, and lots of points of interest in space! &#xA;&#xA;All this time we have been a space game, and yet space felt like it could be much more alive. It's wild to us that ten years in, there are still so many unexplored areas of development like this, and they are still so exciting to us. We feel lucky to have that opportunity.&#xA;&#xA;We love making this game. It means so much to us that most of the people in that &quot;gold master disc&quot; photo from a decade ago are still at Hello Games. It means so much that so many of you, our players, have been on this journey with us since day one - and that newer Travellers are joining us all the time.&#xA;&#xA;Thank you. So much.&#xA;&#xA;Our journey continues. " />
